{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04781","headline":"岳州宴姚绍之 · 张说","name":"岳州宴姚绍之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杞梓滞江滨，光华向日新。\n难兄金作友，媚子玉爲人。\n山水含秋兴，池亭借善邻。\n檐松风送静，院竹鸟来驯。\n翠斝吹黄菊，琱盘鱠紫鳞。\n缓歌将醉舞，爲拂绣衣尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}